## Setup outside git
{% if native_marketplace and 'claude' in agentic_targets and agentic_plugins | length > 0 %}
Register the marketplace plugins once per workspace. Claude stores this outside
the repository, so no committed file can carry it.

```sh
{% for plugin in agentic_plugins -%}
claude plugin install {{ plugin.name }}@{{ plugin.owner_repo }} --scope project
{% endfor -%}
```
{% endif %}
{% if 'kiro' in agentic_targets and mcp_config %}
Open Kiro, then Settings, MCP, and switch on "Enable MCP servers". The server
list itself is committed at `.kiro/settings/mcp.json`.
{% endif %}
{% if not (native_marketplace and 'claude' in agentic_targets and agentic_plugins | length > 0) and not ('kiro' in agentic_targets and mcp_config) %}
Nothing. The committed configuration is the whole setup.
{% endif %}
